# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PalletFit local configuration.
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust the paths to match your machine.
# `.env` is git-ignored and is never committed.
#
# Only EXTERNAL resources need to be configured here; paths *inside* this
# repository are resolved automatically relative to the repo root
# (see utils/env_paths.py).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- External baseline repositories (Experiment 2 reproduction) ------------
# Online-3D-BPP-PCT : https://github.com/alexfrom0815/Online-3D-BPP-PCT
PCT_REPO=/path/to/Online-3D-BPP-PCT
# Online-3D-BPP-DRL : https://github.com/alexfrom0815/Online-3D-BPP-DRL
DRL_REPO=/path/to/Online-3D-BPP-DRL
# GOPT              : https://github.com/Xiong5Heng/GOPT
GOPT_REPO=/path/to/GOPT

# --- Optional: DeepPack3D adapter root (planning/adapters/deeppack3d_adapter.py)
# DP3D_PATH=/path/to/DeepPack3D

# --- Optional: legacy DQN pretrained weight (planning/RL/DQN) ---------------
# DQN_WEIGHT=/path/to/Tetris3D/model_50000.pth
